    "title": "How do you use MediaQuery for responsive layouts?",
    "answer": "MediaQuery provides information about the size and orientation of the screen. Use it to adapt layout:\n\n```dart\nfinal size = MediaQuery.of(context).size;\nfinal width = size.width;\n```",
