    "answer": "To create a Drawer, use the `Drawer` widget within a `Scaffold`:\n\n```dart\nScaffold(\n  appBar: AppBar(title: Text('Title')),\n  drawer: Drawer(\n    child: ListView(\n      children: <Widget>[\n        DrawerHeader(child: Text('Header')),\n        ListTile(title: Text('Item 1')),\n      ],\n    ),\n  ),\n);\n```",
