    "id": "flutter-q-0257",
    "title": "What is the Container widget, and what are its properties?",
    "answer": "Container is a versatile widget for creating layouts. Key properties include:\n\n- `color`: Background color.\n- `width` and `height`: Dimensions.\n- `padding`: Inner spacing.\n- `margin`: Outer spacing.\n- `decoration`: To apply decorations like borders and shadows.",
