    "id": "flutter-q-0303",
    "title": "What is the Model-View-Controller (MVC) architecture?",
    "answer": "**Answer:** MVC is a design pattern that separates an application into three interconnected components:\n\n- **Model:** Manages data and business logic\n- **View:** Handles the UI and presentation\n- **Controller:** Mediates between Model and View",
