    "id": "flutter-q-0447",
    "title": "Naming Conventions",
    "answer": "- Use cases: Verb + Noun (GetUser, UpdateProfile)\n- Repositories: Noun + Repository (UserRepository)\n- Models: Noun + Model (UserModel)\n- Entities: Just Noun (User, Product)",
