    "title": "What is the purpose of the Flex widget in Flutter?",
    "answer": "The [Flex ](https://api.flutter.dev/flutter/widgets/Flex-class.html)widget is used to create a flexible container that can be used to create complex layouts in a Flutter application. The Flex widget provides properties such as direction, mainAxisSize, and mainAxisAlignment, CrossAxisAlignment which can be used to control the layout of its children.\n\nFor example, a developer could use the direction property of the Flex widget to create a horizontal or vertical layout and use the mainAxisAlignment property to align its children to the start, center, or end of the container.",
