    "title": "What is the purpose of the Navigator widget in Flutter?",
    "answer": "The Navigator widget is used to navigate between the routes or screens and manage a stack of screens or routes in a Flutter application. The Navigator widget provides several methods, such as push and pop, which can be used to navigate between screens. \n\nFor example, a developer could use the push method of the Navigator widget to navigate to a new screen in the application, and use the pop method to return to the previous screen. \n\n> To know more refer this article - [Routes and Navigator in Flutter](https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/flutter/routes-and-navigator-in-flutter/).",
